  "body": "## Semantic Memory Build Plan \u2014 implementation\n\nThe \"Grimoire as the one-step thought-and-storage encoding for the VCW\" plan, applied in full: a MIND reflection is appended as **one entry**, and the append itself **encodes** a Grimoire v0.10 statement (record kind, author, time, evidence, force, PARITY) plus a content QUOTE frame. Thought and storage are one step.\n\n### What changed (5 commits)\n\n1. **feat(vcw)**: `grimoire_editions/semantic.py` encoder + `grimoire-v0.10-entry` driver + entry-stream cube guarantees (ids, multi-layer reads, weight overlay, immune marks, verify() hash rechecks, metabolism parity; dedupe keys include evidence+force)\n2. **feat(vcw)**: `semantic_genome()` (thoughts+brain default, veil preserved), compiler explicit-profile rule, `adopt_semantic_memory` operator receipt (new-tissue-only), Body receipt gate\n3. **feat(audits)**: `GRIMOIRE-ENC-01..14` invariant family with red cases + `TM-GRIMOIRE-SEMANTIC` threat-model row\n4. **docs(grimoire)**: `semantic-memory-v1.md` companion (**not an edition** \u2014 frozen editions untouched) + VCW_Guide / AGENTS / README / Mantle_for_Engineers updates\n5. **test(grimoire)**: 21-test pytest suite + one-step demo\n\n### Design highlights\n- DEFAULT evidence/force tables \u2014 never invented; `DIRECT` and `LAW` are gated; unmapped opcodes are inert `QUOTE`\n- Record-kind atoms from canonical section-6 composition rows, cross-checked against the edition at import; invented rows refuse to import\n- DD-Q: the v0.10 one-HEAD rule makes the content QUOTE frame a separate framed run; both runs hex, both hash-covered\n- `grimoire-v0.9`/`grimoire-v0.10` carriers unchanged (`decode_carrier` helper shared)\n\n### Verification (Windows / Python 3.14)\n- `mantle prove`: **186/186** (was 172 baseline; +14)\n- `mantle audit` (Stage-1) / `mantle audit-mind` (Stage-2): **PASSED**\n- `mantle check --strict`: **14/14 GREEN**, reference organism certified\n- `mantle doctor <semantic nest>`: **HEALTHY** \u00b7 `mantle certify <semantic nest>`: **APPLICATION CERTIFIED**\n- `grimoire_tool.py verify`: 209/209 BOOK runs, SELFTEST PASS (edition untouched)\n- spore CONFORMANT \u00b7 release_scan PASS (349 files) \u00b7 pytest 144 passed / 2 skipped\n- tamper proofs `--break-hash/--break-primer/--break-seal` exit non-zero",
